title: Quest4Part1
---
Samantha: You've seen my text, right? #line:quest4-sam-1
Lucas: Yeah, so I guess this is the job? The final one? #line:quest4-lucas-1
Samantha: Yup, we're waiting in a nearby parking lot. #line:quest4-sam-2
Lucas: Okay, I'm gonna boot everything up and I'll be ready to go. #line:quest4-lucas-2
Samantha: Good, we're gonna pull up to the bank. #line:quest4-sam-3
Lucas: I will tell you when I'm online. #line:quest4-lucas-3
Samantha: We'll be waiting. #line:quest4-sam-4
===

title: Quest4Part2
---
Lucas: Okay, I'm ready, what do you need? #line:quest4-lucas-4
Samantha: There is a door in the back, it has an electromagnetic lock. I need you to hack and open it. #line:quest4-sam-5
Lucas: Sounds easy, I'll do it in no time. #line:quest4-lucas-5
===

title: Quest4Part3
---
Lucas: You're free to enter. #line:quest4-lucas-6
Samantha: Great job, going in. #line:quest4-sam-6
Samantha: All clear, we have eyes on the money. #line:quest4-sam-7
Lucas: Good, pack it up. #line:quest4-lucas-7
Samantha: All the money… just for us! #line:quest4-sam-8
Lucas: Aren't you forgetting something? The client's cut? #line:quest4-lucas-8
Samantha: Oh come on, give me a break! Let me have some fun! #line:quest4-sam-9
Lucas: It's a serious job okay? #line:quest4-lucas-9
Samantha: Okay Mr Fun-killer… #line:quest4-sam-10
Unknown: Drop your weapons! Now! #line:quest4-unk-1
Unknown: Get down on the ground! #line:quest4-unk-2
Unknown: You got the boy? #line:quest4-unk-3
Unknown: *Inaudible...* #line:quest4-inaudible
Samantha: Lucas, run! #line:quest4-sam-11
Lucas: Samantha…? Samantha! Shit… I gotta go. #line:quest4-lucas-10
===
